# TTS Cache Directory
# This directory stores cached TTS audio files with MD5-based filenames
# Structure:
#   tts_cache/
#   ├── cache_index.json      # Cache metadata and index
#   ├── <md5_hash_1>.wav     # Cached audio file 1
#   ├── <md5_hash_2>.wav     # Cached audio file 2
#   └── ...                   # More cached files
#
# Managed by TTSCache class in leibniz_tts.py with LRU cleanup
# Default max size: 500 entries
# Default TTL: 30 days
